        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Jin-young, Sunmi, Yubin, Yeeun, Hyerim\n- Organizations: JYP Entertainment\n- Music Groups: Wonder Girls\n- Albums: Wonder Party\n\nFacts:\n- Wonder Girls was a South Korean girl group and band formed by producer Park Jin-young under JYP Entertainment in 2006.\n- Wonder Girls debuted in 2007.\n- Sunmi, born Lee Sun-mi on May 2, 1992, is a South Korean singer.\n- Sunmi debuted in 2007 as a member of Wonder Girls.\n- Sunmi left Wonder Girls in January 2010 to pursue her academic career.\n- The final Wonder Girls line-up consisted of Yubin, Yeeun, Sunmi, and Hyerim.\n- Wonder Party is the third mini album by Wonder Girls.",
